        "nobel_worthiness": "The quantum cascade laser introduced a distinct kind of semiconductor laser with broad impact in infrared and terahertz science and technology.",
        "attribution": "Capasso and Faist were central to the concept and its realization; the enabling growth techniques and wider team contributions warrant careful review.",
        "maturity": "The device principle has been demonstrated for decades and developed into a widely used technology.",
        "uncertainties": [
